    "dialog-title": {
      "styles": {},
      "text": "Creator & Influencer Campaigns"
    },
    "service-slot-7-title": {
      "styles": {},
      "text": "Post-Activation Insights & Reporting\n"
    },
    "service-slot-7-button": {
      "styles": {},
      "serviceDescription": "I capture everything that happens at brand activations and events, then turn it into actionable insights. My reports include what worked and what didn’t, customer feedback, fan interaction counts, daily giveaway totals, event highlights, and recommendations for future events, helping secure the long-term success of your brand marketing.",
      "serviceExample": "When I worked as a mascot for Sargento Cheese during their Cheese Wheeler Tour, I took inventory of all our giveaway items, kept a journal of customer questions and complaints, and cross referenced the feedback from both our Louisville and Minnesota stops to deliver a report providing crucial insights on the event.\n"
    },
    "element-358-div": {
      "styles": {},
      "text": "I help shape creator outreach and on-site coordination of creators so the brand, the talent, and the audience have a clear reason to connect. Campaign scope and deliverables are tailored to the project."
    },
    "dialog-description": {
      "styles": {},
      "text": "I shape creator outreach and coordinate creators on-site, collaborating with them on content so the brand, the talent, and the audience have a clear reason to connect. Campaign scope and deliverables are tailored to each project."
    },
    "dialog-example": {
      "styles": {},
      "text": "For Super Troopers 3, I collaborated with creators Big Semi, the Haroon Twins, and AmourKiki, who have over 2.5 million followers combined. Through our collaborations, I introduced the upcoming film to those audiences.\n"
    },
    "element-362-div": {
      "styles": {},
      "text": "For Super Troopers 3, I worked with creators including Big Semi, the Haroon Twins and AmourKiki, whose audiences collectively reach millions of followers."
    },
